{"symbol":"TME.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:58:07Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Broniewskiego 15","city":"Kedzierzyn-Kozle","zip":"47-225","country":"Poland","phone":"48 77 483 6672","fax":"48 77 483 6672","website":"https://termoexpert.com.pl","industry":"Engineering & Construction","industryKey":"engineering-construction","industryDisp":"Engineering & Construction","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Termoexpert Spólka Akcyjna provides services for the preparation and implementation of energy optimization programs for multi-family residential buildings in Poland. The company offers building energy optimization program which includes analysis, concept, financial assembly, technical documentation, implementation of modernization works, and energy management services. It also provides thermal modernization of buildings comprising insulation of the external walls of the building; replacement of window and door joinery; roof or flat roof insulation; insulation of the ceiling above an unheated basement or insulation of the floor on the ground; and replacement or modernization of central heating and domestic hot water installations, as well as heating systems, such as boilers and heat exchangers. It serves housing cooperatives and communities. The company was founded in 2005 and is headquartered in Kedzierzyn-Kozle, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":13,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Robert  Goluch","title":"President of the Management Board & CEO","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":13.7,"open":13.7,"dayLow":13.7,"dayHigh":13.7,"regularMarketPreviousClose":13.7,"regularMarketOpen":13.7,"regularMarketDayLow":13.7,"regularMarketDayHigh":13.7,"dividendYield":0,"exDividendDate":1628812800,"payoutRatio":0,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":3.61,"beta":-0.893,"volume":1,"regularMarketVolume":1,"averageVolume":55,"averageVolume10days":8